sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as User
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>ProfilePage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ChangePasswordBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ChangePasswordController
  participant User as «entity»<br/>User
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: change my password
  UI->>B: PUT /api/me/password (JWT)
  B->>C: changePassword(Integer userId, ChangePasswordRequest request)
  C->>User: save()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C-->>B: void
  B-->>UI: 204 No Content
  UI-->>A: show result